Non-figure regression floor (Follow_Ups RAG-13; Milestone 1 of plans/2026-09-13-non-figure-floor.md), 2026-09-13
Branch non-figure-floor from 78c132d. Code under test: slice metrics in RetrievalEvaluationService (compiled before the run), no retrieval, set, or weight change.

Harness (one application start, one POST, stop; no RAG_* overrides; the application enable flags never exported; .env holds only POSTGRES_*, SEC_USER_AGENT, OPENAI_API_KEY):
  set -a && source .env && set +a && export INTEGRATION_ACCESS_TOKEN=<32+ chars> SERVER_PORT=8081 && nohup ./mvnw -q -o spring-boot:run > worker-app.log 2>&1 &
  wait for "Started StockRecommendationEngineApplication"
  curl -X POST -H "Authorization: Bearer $INTEGRATION_ACCESS_TOKEN" http://localhost:8081/api/rag/evaluate    -> HTTP 200
  pkill -f spring-boot:run; pkill -f StockRecommendationEngineApplication; lsof -i :8081 empty ("port free")
  No chat model; 42 embeddings for the run, 42 per live-test run (84), 126 in total.

Rows before the run: 21 stored, max id 75. After: 22 stored, new snapshot id 91 (ids 76 to 90 were taken by earlier rolled-back test transactions and are not stored).

